<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-S&amp;P rates Australia's QTC samurai bonds AA.</title>
<headline>RTRS-S&amp;P rates Australia's QTC samurai bonds AA.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Friday it has assigned an AA rating on Queensland Treasury Corporation's 25 billion yen dual currency samurai series eight bonds, which mature on November 25, 1999.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said the rating reflects that of the guarantor, the state of Queensland.</p>
<p>The foreign currency rating outlook for QTC, the central borrowing agency for Queensland's public sector, is positive, it said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
